<title>USA: Specialty Paperboard acquisition review.</title>
<headline>Specialty Paperboard acquisition review.</headline>
<dateline>BRATTLEBORO, Vt. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialty Paperboard Inc and CPG Investors Inc said Monday the Justice Department is seeking more information on their previously announced merger.</p>
<p>Under the merger, Specialty Paperboard is to acquire CPG Investors, which is based in Richmond, Va. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Specialty Paperboard said in a statement that the Justice Department was seeking information under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Act.  </p>
<p>The Justice Department request for information essentially delays the waiting period related to the acquisition until 20 days after the companies have complied with the request.</p>
</text>
